# The xcodegen version that generates the tracked project.pbxproj.
#
# WHY THIS IS PINNED
#
# scripts/verify_pbxproj_in_sync.sh proves the tracked pbxproj is byte-identical
# to what xcodegen produces from gui/project.yml. That comparison is only
# meaningful against a FIXED generator: two xcodegen versions can emit different
# bytes from identical input, and the gate would then report exit 1 -- "the
# tracked Xcode project is STALE, DO NOT SHIP" -- for a toolchain difference
# rather than a real drift.
#
# A gate that goes red for the wrong reason gets ignored, and an ignored gate is
# the thing this whole file exists to prevent.
#
# So a version mismatch is exit 2 (UNAVAILABLE -- the gate could not run), never
# exit 1 (the project is wrong). Those two must never look the same.
#
# WHAT IS MEASURED, AND WHAT IS NOT
#
# Measured 2026-08-13: 2.44.1 reproduces the tracked pbxproj byte-for-byte.
# NOT measured: that any other version fails to. This is pinned because the
# reproduction is only demonstrated for 2.44.1, not because a specific other
# version is known to break.
#
# TO BUMP: install the new version, `cd gui && xcodegen generate`, commit the
# regenerated pbxproj AND this file in the same commit. If the pbxproj does not
# change, the bump is free; if it does, that diff is the toolchain's, and it
# needs to land deliberately rather than inside an unrelated PR.
2.44.1
